  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_01",
      "hash64": "EB33E0E6A24382AC",
      "text": "这里的书太多了，读都读不完……\\n来到这所学校真是太好了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_01",
      "hash64": "A478CD916FCE4570",
      "text": "上过对战学的课程后，\\n就觉得自己能够变强！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_07",
      "hash64": "A478D3916FCE4FA2",
      "text": "泰姆老师的数学课也能\\n在无意中学到很多对战的知识呢～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_09",
      "hash64": "EB33E8E6A2439044",
      "text": "虽然和宝可梦没什么关系，\\n但语言学也很有趣哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
