    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_10",
      "hash64": "EB305BE6A2406AD6",
      "text": "理科课程有个叫做牡丹的女生，\\n不但头脑聪明，还擅长机械。\\r\\n听说她最近回学校上课了哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_08",
      "hash64": "A478D6916FCE54BB",
      "text": "朗读课本的内容就能将\\n眼睛、嘴巴和耳朵全部用上来记忆！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_09",
      "hash64": "A478D5916FCE5308",
      "text": "我想学习宝可梦相关的知识，\\n所以进入这所学校就读，\\r\\n但也开始对理科课程感兴趣了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_11",
      "hash64": "EB305CE6A2406C89",
      "text": "虫属性宝可梦会吃草……\\n所以虫属性能克制草属性！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_boy_12",
      "hash64": "EB3059E6A2406770",
      "text": "我问了好几次问题以后，\\n被老师记住了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_03",
      "hash64": "A75C187C419B1996",
      "text": "好伤药和厉害伤药\\n哪种回复量更多……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_04",
      "hash64": "A75C1B7C419B1EAF",
      "text": "你知道天星队吗？\\n他们很久之前闹出过麻烦呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_poke_24",
      "hash64": "01B48409590A47B4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 76]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "004C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_03",
      "hash64": "4A9BB8FB162BB5D4",
      "text": "我不是老师而是学生。\\n你看！我穿着制服哦？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_06",
      "hash64": "4A9BB5FB162BB0BB",
      "text": "钢属性招式对妖精属性宝可梦\\n效果绝佳……我说对了吗！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_man_07",
      "hash64": "4A9BB4FB162BAF08",
      "text": "对有两种属性的宝可梦，\\n要掌握它的属性相克好难啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_02",
      "hash64": "A75C197C419B1B49",
      "text": "因为晚上也能上课，\\n所以我白天工作也能兼顾上学。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_05",
      "hash64": "A75C1A7C419B1CFC",
      "text": "要是睡觉的话一天就结束了，\\n觉得那样好可惜所以熬夜……\\r\\n可是第二天又会后悔呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_woman_06",
      "hash64": "A75C1D7C419B2215",
      "text": "我捡到了宝可梦\\n掉落的硬币，\\c\\n于是一直保管着想还给它，\\n可那只宝可梦太小了，我找不到它呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
