    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "sch_entrance01_girl_06",
      "hash64": "A478D4916FCE5155",
      "text": "晚上的学校好神奇！\\n出入的人和白天不太一样。\\c\\n城镇外面也是如此，\\n白天和晚上能遇到不同的宝可梦哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
